  "description": "If Nelson had decided to not hide his secret, his destiny would have been quite different. The extremist Robespierre would have done everything in his power to harm the Admiral, accusing him of treason. Nelson and his wife would have then become fugitives. They would have taken refuge with Cornelius, despite some reticence on his part at first. Nevertheless, the presence of a man who was very skilled and well informed on his enemies would have convinced him to accept. Over time, Nelson would become the Shapeshifters’ right-hand man and together they would have been able to destroy the Republic.",
